    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d251">

                <pb facs="0435" n="331" xml:id="pg331"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 200.11L44/14 and 15.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé
                            d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams—Paraphrases.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">San José</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-07-17">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 17, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Lawson arrested today. The Minister for Foreign Affairs tells me that he will be
                    deported for Galveston on the 18th instant.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Langhorne</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
